# Copy to devops/production.env (gitignored), fill in, then run devops/push-env.sh.
# NODE_ENV, HOST, PORT and DATABASE_PATH are set by the systemd unit, not here.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# Comma-separated; these accounts get the /admin pages (users with their emails, metrics, spend, problem and people reports, language requests) and can play any learner's conversation partner audio.
ADMIN_EMAILS=
# Every paid AI call goes to OpenAI: the "Why?" explainer, conversation mode and quiz audio (cached on disk); unset disables the first two. Every paid call counts toward DAILY_SPEND_CAP (USD per user per UTC day, default 1); once reached, paid calls are refused until midnight UTC and free practice stays open.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Healthchecks.io ping URL (period 1 day). The app pings it daily and again on server errors (at most hourly); Healthchecks alerts on a failure ping or a missing day.
HEALTHCHECK_URL=
